        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>English/Chinese Reading with Vocabulary Notes</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = { tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']] } };\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" async></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    font-family: \"Segoe UI\", Arial, sans-serif;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n    color: #111;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 10px 20px;\n    background: #fff;\n  }\n  .page {\n    display: flex;\n    max-width: 1000px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n  }\n  .main-col {\n    flex: 3;\n    padding-right: 15px;\n    text-align: justify;\n  }\n  .side-col {\n    flex: 1.1;\n    border-left: 1px solid #ccc;\n    padding-left: 15px;\n    font-size: 12.5px;\n  }\n  p {\n    margin: 3px 0 8px 0;\n  }\n  .hl-yellow {\n    background-color: #fff59d;\n    text-decoration: underline;\n  }\n  .hl-green {\n    background-color: #a5d6a7;\n  }\n  .hl-pink {\n    background-color: #f8bbd0;\n  }\n  .side-entry {\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n  }\n  .side-term {\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"page\">\n  <div class=\"main-col\">\n\n    <p>此外，社会、教育和文化<span class=\"hl-yellow\">促使强化</span>某些关于孤独的<span class=\"hl-pink\">非理性</span>信念。</p>\n\n    <p>Society has a <span class=\"hl-yellow\">tendency</span> to think that if someone is 40 years old and living alone, there's something wrong.</p>\n\n    <p>社会有一种<span class=\"hl-yellow\">倾向</span>，如果一个人40岁了，仍在独自生活，那就有问题了。</p>\n\n    <p>However, it should be realized that the central problem tends to be the belief <span class=\"hl-yellow\">surrounding</span> it.</p>\n\n    <p>然而，应该认识到，核心问题往往是<span class=\"hl-yellow\">围绕</span>它的信念。</p>\n\n    <p>In other words, the problem isn't loneliness itself, it's what's said about it, how it's <span class=\"hl-yellow\">interpreted</span>, and the meaning it's given.</p>\n\n    <p>换句话说，问题不在于孤独本身，而在于人们对它说了什么，如何<span class=\"hl-yellow\">解释</span>它，以及它被赋予的意义。</p>\n\n    <p>Today, we live in crowded places and are <span class=\"hl-yellow\">incredibly</span> connected to each other, thanks to social media.</p>\n\n    <p>如今，多亏了社交媒体，我们生活在拥挤的地方，彼此之间有着<span class=\"hl-yellow\">难以置信</span>的联系。</p>\n\n    <p>Nevertheless, it may be that this isn't enough for you, and you feel alone because you're single or live <span class=\"hl-yellow\">completely</span> <span class=\"hl-yellow\">alone</span>.</p>\n\n    <p>然而，这对你来说可能还不够，你会感到孤独，因为你单身或者<span class=\"hl-yellow\">完全独居</span>。</p>\n\n    <p>However, as we <span class=\"hl-yellow\">mentioned</span> earlier, that isn't the problem.</p>\n\n    <p>然而，正如我们之前<span class=\"hl-yellow\">提到的</span>，这不是问题。</p>\n\n    <p>It's your way of seeing it and the <span class=\"hl-yellow\">dialogue</span> you're having with yourself about it that's the issue.</p>\n\n    <p>问题在于你看待它的方式和你与自己的<span class=\"hl-yellow\">对话</span>。</p>\n\n    <p>That's what makes you feel anxious, <span class=\"hl-yellow\">depressed</span>, and empty inside.</p>\n\n    <p>这就是让你感到焦虑，<span class=\"hl-yellow\">沮丧</span>和内心空虚的原因。</p>\n\n    <p>Obviously, if you tell yourself a hundred times a day or more, that being alone is a terrible thing, that nobody loves you, and you'll <span class=\"hl-yellow\">end up</span> dying alone, your emotions will be extremely <span class=\"hl-yellow\">intense</span> and you'll feel <span class=\"hl-yellow\">dreadful</span> because of these ideas and thoughts that don't even <span class=\"hl-yellow\">correspond</span> with reality.</p>\n\n    <p>显然，如果你每天告诉自己一百次或更多次，孤独是一件可怕的...</p>\n\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"side-col\">\n\n    <div class=\"side-entry\">\n      <div class=\"side-term hl-pink\">irrational</div>\n      <div>adj.非理性的，不合理的，荒谬的</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"side-entry\">\n      <div class=\"side-term hl-green\">同义词:</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"side-entry\">\n      <div class=\"side-term hl-green\">unreasonable</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"side-entry\">\n      <div class=\"side-term hl-yellow\">surround</div>\n      <div>: v. 环绕，围绕</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"side-entry\">\n      <div class=\"side-term hl-yellow\">interpret</div>\n      <div>:v. 诠释；说明</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"side-entry\">\n      <div class=\"side-term hl-yellow\">incredibly</div>\n      <div>:adv. 极端地，非常地</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"side-entry\">\n      <div class=\"side-term hl-yellow\">completely</div>\n      <div>: adv.彻底地，完全地；完整地</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"side-entry\">\n      <div class=\"side-term hl-pink\">alone</div>\n      <div>:adv.单独，独自；</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"side-entry\">\n      <div class=\"side-term hl-green\">go it alone</div>\n      <div>独力；独自干；单干</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"side-entry\">\n      <div class=\"side-term hl-pink\">loneliness</div>\n      <div>:n. 孤独；寂寞</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"side-entry\">\n      <div class=\"side-term hl-green\">lonely</div>\n      <div>:adj. lonely life / existence</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"side-entry\">\n      <div class=\"side-term hl-pink\">end up</div>\n      <div>:最终；结果；</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"side-entry\">\n      <div class=\"side-term hl-yellow\">correspond</div>\n      <div>: V.符合；相一致；通信</div>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
